OL,3,GNEWSAOfsted suspends four nurseries    
OL,4,Aafter death of boy                     
OL,6,FFour nurseries in Greater Manchester   
OL,7,Fhave been temporarily closed after the 
OL,8,Fdeath of a three-year-old boy.         
OL,10,FCosy Toes Nursery, in Middleton, was   
OL,11,Fsuspended from Ofsted's childcare      
OL,12,Fregister on 3 November after Thiago    
OL,13,FWall became critically ill there on 2  
OL,14,FNovember and died three days later.    
OL,16,FOfsted has since confirmed it has also 
OL,17,Fsuspended the registrations of three   
OL,18,Fother Middleton nurseries run by Cosy  
OL,19,FToes Nursery Ltd.                      
